<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY FINMIN NAMES KEKESI AS NEW TAX OFFICE HEAD.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY FINMIN NAMES KEKESI AS NEW TAX OFFICE HEAD.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finance Minister Peter Medgyessy has named Laszlo Kekesi as the new head of Hungary's Tax Office, the Finance Ministry said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Kekesi replaces Zoltan Pitti on January 1. Pitti announced his resignation two weeks ago after what he called &quot;unjust attacks&quot; against him.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
